{"id":46928,"date":"2025-11-28T19:40:22","date_gmt":"2025-11-28T18:40:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-pinhel-2025\/"},"modified":"2026-08-23T16:28:02","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T15:28:02","slug":"sao-silvestre-pinhel-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-pinhel-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Pinhel 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: PROVA S\u00c3O SILVESTRE DE PINHEL 2025 --><\/p>\n<div  style=\"max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 16px 60px 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 1: SOBRE O EVENTO --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 30px); color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;\">Sobre a <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Pinhel<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n      A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Pinhel 2025<\/strong> (S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade Falc\u00e3o) realizou-se a 31 de Dezembro de 2025, animando o centro hist\u00f3rico da cidade de Pinhel, no distrito da Guarda. O evento encerrou o calend\u00e1rio desportivo anual com grande entusiasmo, reunindo atletas de elite, amadores e fam\u00edlias nas vertentes de corrida e caminhada.\n    <\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      Com partida junto ao Tribunal de Pinhel e um tra\u00e7ado nobre que percorreu as imponentes muralhas medievais da Cidade Falc\u00e3o, a prova afirmou-se como uma das tradi\u00e7\u00f5es desportivas mais marcantes da regi\u00e3o das Beiras.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #C4B5FD; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 800;\">\u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica do Evento<\/h2>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\">\n<div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Data Realizada<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;\">31 de Dezembro de 2025<\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\">\n<div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;\">Pinhel, Guarda<\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\">\n<div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;\">Corrida 10 km | Caminhada &#038; Kids<\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\">\n<div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Piso &#038; Terreno<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;\">Asfalto e Cal\u00e7ada Hist\u00f3rica<\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 3: GEOMETRIA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; Percurso<\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n      O circuito urbano de Pinhel apresenta um perfil com ondula\u00e7\u00f5es moderadas t\u00edpicas da Beira Interior, combinando longas retas de asfalto com tro\u00e7os t\u00e9cnicos no interior das muralhas hist\u00f3ricas. A envolv\u00eancia dos monumentos da Cidade Falc\u00e3o proporciona um ambiente inspirador a cada quil\u00f3metro.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 4: BANNER CALCULADORA DE PACE --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.25) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; color: #FFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Quer simular o seu tempo ideal de corrida?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Utilize a calculadora oficial de ritmo para definir a sua estrat\u00e9gia de prova.<\/p>\n<p>    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #6D28D9 100%); color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; border-radius: 20px; padding: 10px 28px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px;\">Aceder \u00e0 Calculadora de Pace \u2197<\/a><br \/>\n  <\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 5: ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em Pinhel<\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      Pinhel oferece unidades acolhedoras de turismo de habita\u00e7\u00e3o e alojamento local no centro hist\u00f3rico e nas freguesias lim\u00edtrofes, permitindo uma estadia relaxante com acesso f\u00e1cil ao local de partida da corrida.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 6: SOBRE O LOCAL & GASTRONOMIA --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; Gastronomia Regional<\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      Conhecida como a Cidade Falc\u00e3o, Pinhel destaca-se pelas suas torres medievais e pela rica tradi\u00e7\u00e3o gastron\u00f3mica da Beira Alta, onde sobressaem o ensopado de borrego, os queijos curados e os prestigiados vinhos da Beira Interior.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 7: FAQS --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px;\">\n<h2  style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 800;\">Perguntas <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><\/h2>\n<div  style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;\">\n<details  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary  style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #FFF; cursor: pointer;\">Onde consultar os resultados da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Pinhel 2025?<\/summary>\n<div  style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es da edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2025 est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na plataforma de cronometragem associada ao evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary  style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #FFF; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realizou a partida da prova?<\/summary>\n<div  style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">A partida da prova decorreu junto ao Tribunal de Pinhel, percorrendo o circuito urbano central.<\/div>\n<\/details><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":46929,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,624,47],"event_type_2":[212,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46928","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-pinhel-guarda","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-kids","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-guarda","event_type_2-porto-e-norte"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Corrida-de-Sao-Silvestre-Pinhel-2025-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46928","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"c